'''The Greatest Diablo''' (絶・メガサターン, ''Zetsu・Megasatān'', '''Absolute Mega Satan''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]] and appears every Friday. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]]: Cat Researcher.

